<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schering-Plough raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schering-Plough raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Schering-Plough Corp to neutral from underperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/4 at 76-3/8.</p>
</text>
